Face Symmetry Lab
=================

This product bundles no model weights. Model assets are fetched by an explicit
`scripts/bootstrap_models.py` run and verified against `configs/model-manifest.json`
(SHA-256). The notices below cover the assets the manifest pins and the runtime
dependencies whose licences require attribution.


