Derived configuration
---------------------

`configs/metrics/symmetry-2d-v1.json` contains a left/right landmark
correspondence map derived from the MediaPipe Face Landmarker mesh topology by
`scripts/derive_landmark_map.py`. It stores landmark indices only — no model
weights and no face-derived data.


